temize}}}\n\n\\vspace{3pt}\n\n\\item{\\cventry{Jan 2024 - Jul 2025}{Technical Consultant \\& Systems Engineer}{Client Engagements}{Remote}{}{\\vspace{1pt}\n\\begin{itemize}\n    \\item \\textbf{Urlink} (Apr 2025 - Jul 2025): Managed technical evaluations and mapped operational requirements directly with client leadership, resolving technical objections and deploying automated workflows.\n    \\item \\textbf{UltraStrategy} (Dec 2024 - May 2025): Engineered data extraction pipelines, conducting hands-on technical discovery and utilizing API integration architectures for fast-moving environments.\n    \\item \\textbf{Get2Germany.com} (Jan 2024 - May 2024): Integrated third-party REST APIs and optimized system architectures, successfully translating complex backend capabilities to end-user functionality.\n\\end{itemize}}}\n\n\\end{itemize}\n\\vspace{3pt}\n\n% ============================================================\n%     EDUCATION\n% ============================================================\n\\section{Education}\n\\vspace{1pt}\n\\begin{itemize}\n\\item{\\cventry{Oct 2020 - Jun 2024}{BA Philosophy, International Studies \\& Economics (Minor: Entrepreneurship)}{Ca' Foscari University of Venice}{Venice, Italy}{}{}}\n\\end{itemize}\n\\vspace{3pt}\n\n% ============================================================\n%     CERTIFICATIONS \\& ADDITIONAL INFORMATION\n% ============================================================\n\\section{Certifications \\& Additional Information}\n\\vspace{1pt}\n\\begin{itemize}\n\\item \\textbf{Certifications}: Microsoft Copilot Studio Agent Academy, Microsoft AI Agents, Microsoft Power Automate, Tray.AI Build Practitioner.\n\\item \\textbf{Work Authorization}: EU Long Term Residence Permit (Italy). Open to EMEA remote work and necessary travel.\n\\item \\textbf{Languages}: English (Fluent/C1), Hindi (Native), Italian (Beginner).\n\\end{itemize}\n\\end{document}\n\n```\n\n### Cover Letter (veriff_cl.tex)\n```latex\n\\documentclass[11pt,