ons and building compelling demonstrations. At FlowSpace, I scoped technical requirements directly with clients, building and deploying bespoke integration architectures and workflows that resolved concrete business challenges. I take ownership of the technical sales cycle, ensuring seamless PoC deployments.\n    \\item \\textbf{Expertise in APIs, Webhooks \\& Integrations:} I architect and manage end-to-end API integrations, utilizing REST APIs, SDKs, and JSON data structures on a daily basis. My experience includes implementing robust webhook handling and API testing using tools like Postman, ensuring that complex integrations are reliable, secure, and scalable.\n    \\item \\textbf{Translating Complexity to Stakeholders:} A core part of my role has been acting as the bridge between technical execution and business value. Whether demonstrating a new API integration or addressing architectural objections, I ensure that both technical and non-technical stakeholders clearly understand the value proposition and the solution.\n\\end{itemize}\n\n\\noindent With my strong commercial mindset, hands-on technical foundation, and fluency in English, I am highly motivated by Veriff's mission to protect honest people online. I am proactive, self-starting, and accustomed to managing multiple technical opportunities simultaneously. \n\n\\noindent I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my execution-focused approach and expertise in integration architecture can accelerate your technical sales process in EMEA.\n\n\\noindent I look forward to hearing from you.\n\n\\vspace{10pt}\n\n\\noindent Kind regards,\n\n\\vspace{10pt}\n\n\\noindent Prabhavit Gupta\n\n\\end{document}\n\n```\n"
